Description: Crash-safe custom GIF animations for the BackBoard respring screen on rootless iOS 15 and 16. Selection is inert and processed off the Settings main thread; Apply verifies the real preferences file and restarts backboardd through the physically validated path before bounded ImageIO decoding and dedicated full-screen overlay attachment, with automatic quarantine on failure.
